stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> PROSPECT: T1 marketing visit or partner introduction
    PROSPECT --> FREE: T2 tenant created, headcount under 20
    PROSPECT --> FILE: T3 self-serve checkout completed at any headcount
    FREE --> FILE: T4 census crosses the 20 line, or the tenant elects File
    FILE --> SCALE_BAND: T5 census crosses the 200 line
    SCALE_BAND --> FILE: T6 census stays under the 200 line for the whole step-down window
    FILE --> DUNNING: T7 mandate debit fails
    SCALE_BAND --> DUNNING: T7 mandate debit fails
    DUNNING --> FILE: T8 payment recovered inside the grace window
    DUNNING --> READ_ONLY: T9 grace window expires
    READ_ONLY --> FILE: T10 arrears cleared
    READ_ONLY --> CLOSED: T11 closure notice expires
    FILE --> CLOSING: T12 tenant cancels, effective at term end
    CLOSING --> FILE: T13 cancellation withdrawn before term end
    CLOSING --> CLOSED: T14 term ends
    CLOSED --> FILE: T15 win-back inside the post-closure retention window
    CLOSED --> [*]: T16 retention window expires, export offered and evidenced

    note left of FREE
      FREE never enters DUNNING.
      There is no invoice to fail.
    end note

    note right of FILE
      A tenant that has crossed 20 is
      never auto-returned to FREE.
      Down-tiering needs a named approver.
    end note

    note right of READ_ONLY
      Statutory artefacts, the filing ledger
      and full export stay available.
      Never withheld as a collections lever.
    end note
